   "updated": 1700000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "How the request flows",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "baseline": 19,
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "How the request flows",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "eh0lyb35efn8u",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 56,
   "y": 3097.5,
   "width": 828,
   "height": 120.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1882408955,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 2055200162,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1700000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. Client calls the invoke URL (no /stage prefix for $default).\n2. API matches the route key: method + path.\n3. Integration forwards the whole request to Lambda as an event (payload 2.0: rawPath,\nrequestContext.http.method, pathParameters, queryStringParameters).\n4. Lambda returns {statusCode, headers, body}; API Gateway relays it.\n5. One access-log line is written to CloudWatch.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "baseline": 14,
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "1. Client calls the invoke URL (no /stage prefix for $default).\n2. API matches the route key: method + path.\n3. Integration forwards the whole request to Lambda as an event (payload 2.0: rawPath,\nrequestContext.http.method, pathParameters, queryStringParameters).\n4. Lambda returns {statusCode, headers, body}; API Gateway relays it.\n5. One access-log line is written to CloudWatch.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
