   "updated": 1700000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "- HTTP API is roughly 70% cheaper than REST, with lower latency.\n- No Deploy button: auto-deploy is on.\n- No matching route: 404 Not Found.\n- Missing Lambda permission: 500.\n- Code written for payload 1.0 on a 2.0 route: KeyError.\n- Test GET in the browser, POST with Postman or fetch().",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "baseline": 14,
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "- HTTP API is roughly 70% cheaper than REST, with lower latency.\n- No Deploy button: auto-deploy is on.\n- No matching route: 404 Not Found.\n- Missing Lambda permission: 500.\n- Code written for payload 1.0 on a 2.0 route: KeyError.\n- Test GET in the browser, POST with Postman or fetch().",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
