   "updated": 1700000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "- Nothing is live until you Deploy API.\n- API keys meter clients; they are not security.\n- CORS needs OPTIONS (MOCK) plus headers from Lambda.\n- Canary: send 20% to a new deployment, then promote.\n- Lambda role needs DynamoDB actions on the table.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "baseline": 14,
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "- Nothing is live until you Deploy API.\n- API keys meter clients; they are not security.\n- CORS needs OPTIONS (MOCK) plus headers from Lambda.\n- Canary: send 20% to a new deployment, then promote.\n- Lambda role needs DynamoDB actions on the table.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
