   "text": "- Simple proxy to Lambda or HTTP, lowest cost: HTTP API\n- API keys, usage plans, validation, caching, WAF, canary, mapping templates: REST API\n- Real-time two-way messages: WebSocket API\n\nEndpoint: Edge for global clients, Regional for same-region clients, Private for VPC-\nonly access.",
