   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "- Lambda proxy: the default choice\n- HTTP proxy: an existing web service\n- AWS service: SQS, DynamoDB, SNS, Step Functions without Lambda\n- VPC Link: private ALB, NLB or ECS\n- Mock: prototypes and CORS preflight\n- Non-proxy (custom): when you need VTL mapping",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "baseline": 14,
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "- Lambda proxy: the default choice\n- HTTP proxy: an existing web service\n- AWS service: SQS, DynamoDB, SNS, Step Functions without Lambda\n- VPC Link: private ALB, NLB or ECS\n- Mock: prototypes and CORS preflight\n- Non-proxy (custom): when you need VTL mapping",
   "autoResize": true,
